        [ sh:datatype <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Person> ;
            sh:path <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/costumeDesigner> ],
        [ sh:datatype <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Person> ;
            sh:path <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/editing> ] ;
    sh:targetClass <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Film> .

